    "reviews": "\u201cVignettes achieves something almost transcendent\u201d<br>Julie Muncy - WIRED<br><br>\u201cVignettes is mesmerizing in its simplicity. Part puzzle, part interactive toy, it contains endless charm within the smallest, most mundane objects\u201d<br>Chloi Rad - IGN<br><br>\u201cVignettes is a toy. And that is why it\u2019s completely splendid.\u201d<br>John Walker - Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
